## Patterns & Connections

### 1. Daily Actions Group
All verbs you use daily:
- 食べる たべる = eat
- 飲む のむ = drink  
- 見る みる = see/watch
- 聞く きく = hear/listen/ask
- 読む よむ = read
- 書く かく = write
- 言う いう = say

### 2. Shopping Pair
買う かう = buy ↔ 売る うる = sell  
Both use 貝 radical because old money was shells.

### 3. Rest vs Work
休む やすむ = rest  
Opposite concept to 働く はたらく = work [N5 later]

### 4. Compound Words
- 図書館 としょかん = library [book + write + building]
- 食堂 しょくどう = cafeteria [eat + hall]
- 新聞 しんぶん = newspaper [new + hear]

